## 2. (G-IDX.1): the ledger

### ⟨1⟩4. LEMMA L-B (finite-time and ordered-limit ledger)

**ASSUME.** H-MQG(1)--(4), `t_-<t_+`, and `W=[a,b]`.

**PROVE.** If escaped charge is positive outward, then

`2s[ϱ_{t_+}(𝔛_W)-ϱ_{t_-}(𝔛_W)]=-Δq_esc(W;t_-,t_+)`. **(IDX.3)**

